# {{HARNESS_NAME}}

A working harness for design work with AI: the rules, memory, workflows and checks that sit around the AI so every session follows the same process and leaves reusable output behind.

**Owner:** {{OWNER}} · **Context:** {{CONTEXT_LABEL}}

## The five parts

| Part | What it is | Where |
|---|---|---|
| **Rails** | What output must stay inside: tokens, components, patterns, ux-context, confidentiality | `system/`, `context/ux-context.md`, `.harness/confidential.txt` |
| **Memory** | Where truth lives between sessions and people | `context/`, `docs/decisions.md`, `records/handovers.md` |
| **Moves** | The workflow: stages, skills, agents, hooks | `CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/` |
| **Checks** | Sensors (deterministic) then the gate (a separate evaluator) | `scripts/harness_check.py`, `.claude/skills/gate/` |
| **Loop** | How each miss becomes a permanent fix | `docs/evolution.md`, `docs/decisions.md` |

## Start here

- New to it: `docs/onboarding.md`.
- Status at a glance: `python3 scripts/build_dashboard.py`, then open `dashboard/index.html`.
- What the AI follows: `CLAUDE.md`.
